title: "Indonesia Power Map: Data Collection"
abstract: >-
  A data collection of Indonesia's power system for modelling: existing power plants, substations and
  70-500 kV transmission lines, and every item of the RUPTL 2025-2034 generation, substation and
  transmission plan, in CSV and GeoJSON.
type: dataset
